{"id":"n89282-3-7","stage":4,"title":"훈훈하다 · 散发出味道。","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89282-3-7-1","ko":"훈훈한 고향 냄새가 생각이 나네.","zh":"想起了故乡那温暖的气息。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"훈훈한","meaning":"散发出味道。","explanation":"훈훈하다：散发出味道；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"훈훈하다","audio":"/audio/1b1e1109368712ee5057.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89282","senseId":"3","lemma":"훈훈하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"훈훈한","audio":"/audio/67e8d1b65d335070d1f9.mp3"}},{"text":"고향","meaning":"故乡，家乡","explanation":"고향：故乡，家乡。","readings":[{"term":"고향","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27364","senseId":"1","lemma":"고향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고향","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3"}},{"text":"냄새가","meaning":"气味，味道，香味，臭味","explanation":"냄새：气味，味道，香味，臭味；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"냄새","audio":"/audio/a67d0d1b921d4bc49922.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58180","senseId":"1","lemma":"냄새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"냄새가","audio":"/audio/355d1601ad77a55c071d.mp3"}},{"text":"생각이","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"생각：念头，想法；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각이","audio":"/audio/4cbc2bb73481851c34fc.mp3"}},{"text":"나네.","meaning":"想起，想到","explanation":"나다：想起，想到；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"21","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나네","audio":"/audio/9cbca1019edbebacfbb8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1b1e1109368712ee","term":"훈훈하다","zh":"散发出味道。","audio":"/audio/1b1e1109368712ee5057.mp3","entryId":"89282","definition":"散发出味道。","pronunciation":["